        ["4"] = <"Rhodes J, Clay C, Phillips M. The surface area of the hand and the palm for estimating percentage of total body surface area: results of a meta-analysis. Br J Dermatol. 2013 Jul;169(1):76-84. doi: 10.1111/bjd.12290. PMID: 23448271.">
